.TH smi-profiles-location "1" "October 2025" "SMI Toolset 0.100.0" "SMI Base Command"
.SH NAME
smi-profiles-location \- Print the SMI profiles directory location
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-profiles-location
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-profiles-location
prints the absolute path to the profiles directory within the SMI library location.
.SH AVAILABLE PROFILES
.PP
Profiles are shell scripts sourced by \fBterm-activate\fR(1) to set up PATH and environment
variables for a specific tool version.
The following profiles are installed in the SMI profiles directory.
Each profile name corresponds to a \fB.profile\fR file; use it with \fBterm-activate\fR.
